  "prefLabel": "Ins 2602.10 Penalties",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 2602.10 Penalties. An insurer or its officers, directors, producers or employees that violate any of the provisions of this part, or knowingly participate in or abet such violation, shall be subject to the penalty provisions of RSA 400-A:15, III.\n\nSource. #9333, eff 12-5-08; ss by #11173, eff 12-5-16",
